# Deep links on Cloudflare Pages (D-deploy). Each route family of src/app/routes.tsx is proxied to
# the root page with status 200, so the address bar keeps the link and its query string.
# Cloudflare applies every rule before it looks for a file, so there is no catch-all: /* would
# also serve the page for /assets/, /images/ and /market/. Never add a rule for /assets/,
# /images/, /market/, /robots.txt, /favicon.svg or /public-build.json. Static rules come before
# the splat rules, as Cloudflare's docs ask. node scripts/check-public.mjs checks this file.
/demo     /  200
/shop     /  200
/sell     /  200
/buyer    /  200
/owner    /  200
/shop/*   /  200
/sell/*   /  200
/store/*  /  200
/maker/*  /  200
/studio/* /  200
/dev/*    /  200
